              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>An investigation in three parts on inner life and conditions of life. 1. Satisfaction / feelings and expectations about course of life in past, present and future / evaluation of life / feeling and self in general. 2. A day-to-day report during two weeks on feelings ( life, freedom, safety, energy, health and special circumstances hours of sleep, use of drugs, alcohol ) 3. Goals in life and self-image meaning of life / place in the world / honesty / spontaneity / optimism / hedonism / self-confidence.</p>"
                }
              }
